<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Swiss Reinsurance.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Swiss Reinsurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Reinsurance shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1450 CHF		  PREMIUM	12.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.25 CHF		  GEARING	11.2 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 08.JAN.96-20.APR.98   PAYDATE	07.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1395 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
